# UI Tokens

Every visual value lives here as a CSS variable. Code contains NO hard-coded hex values — ever.

```css
:root {
  /* color */
  --bg: {{...}};        --surface: {{...}};    --ink: {{...}};
  --ink-muted: {{...}}; --accent: {{...}};     --border: {{...}};
  --success: {{...}};   --warning: {{...}};    --danger: {{...}};

  /* spacing scale */
  --space-1: {{4px}}; --space-2: {{8px}}; --space-3: {{12px}};
  --space-4: {{16px}}; --space-6: {{24px}}; --space-8: {{32px}}; --space-12: {{48px}};

  /* radius */
  --radius-sm: {{...}}; --radius-md: {{...}}; --radius-lg: {{...}};

  /* type scale */
  --font-display: {{...}}; --font-body: {{...}};
  --text-xs: {{...}}; --text-sm: {{...}}; --text-base: {{...}};
  --text-lg: {{...}}; --text-xl: {{...}}; --text-2xl: {{...}}; --text-4xl: {{...}};

  /* elevation */
  --shadow-sm: {{...}}; --shadow-md: {{...}};
}
{{dark theme: duplicate block under [data-theme="dark"] or .dark}}
